      "markdownBody": "# CodeRabbit findings for PAN-5186 (PR #5196)\n\nCodeRabbit posted 8 inline finding(s). CodeRabbit is advisory: nothing waits for these,\nbut each one gets an answer, either a fix or a reply with your reason.\n\n- Thread 4566713145 · src/dashboard/frontend/src/components/explorer/ExplorerPane.tsx:257 [Minor]: Share the directory request limit with the normal loader.\n  https://github.com/eltmon/overdeck/pull/5196#discussion_r4566713145\n- Thread 4566713153 · src/dashboard/frontend/src/components/explorer/ExplorerPane.tsx:258 [Minor]: Cancel Expand all writes when the pane unmounts.\n  https://github.com/eltmon/overdeck/pull/5196#discussion_r4566713153\n- Thread 4566713164 · src/dashboard/frontend/src/components/explorer/git/git-decoration.ts:104 [Major]: Partially staged files cannot be staged from the explorer menu.\n  https://github.com/eltmon/overdeck/pull/5196#discussion_r4566713164\n- Thread 4566713174 · src/dashboard/frontend/src/components/explorer/menu/ExplorerContextMenu.tsx:133 [Minor]: Hide or disable Download until the endpoint exists.\n  https://github.com/eltmon/overdeck/pull/5196#discussion_r4566713174\n- Thread 4566713186 · src/dashboard/frontend/src/components/explorer/search/QuickOpen.tsx:51 [Minor]: Clear or disable results when the query changes.\n  https://github.com/eltmon/overdeck/pull/5196#discussion_r4566713186\n- Thread 4566713192 · src/dashboard/frontend/src/components/explorer/tree/ExplorerTree.tsx:175 [Minor]: Keep the active descendant mounted.\n  https://github.com/eltmon/overdeck/pull/5196#discussion_r4566713192\n- Thread 4566713200 · src/dashboard/frontend/src/components/explorer/watch/explorer-watch-hub.ts:41 [Minor]: Remove the provisional channel when stream creation throws.\n  https://github.com/eltmon/overdeck/pull/5196#discussion_r4566713200\n- Thread 4566713208 · src/dashboard/frontend/src/components/Stage/index.tsx:118 [Major]: Explorer-opened files do not appear when the layout is split.\n  https://github.com/eltmon/overdeck/pull/5196#discussion_r4566713208\n\n## What to do\n\n1. Read each thread (open its link, or the code at the path and line).\n2. If you agree with a finding, fix it.\n3. If you reject a finding, reply on its thread with your reason:\n   `gh api repos/eltmon/overdeck/pulls/5196/comments/<thread id>/replies -f body=\"<reason>\"`\n4. If you changed code: run the quality gates on what you touched, commit, push, then run `pan review request PAN-5186`.\n   If you only replied, you are done.\n5. If PR #5196 has already merged when you read this, nothing more lands on it: open a follow-up issue\n   for the findings you agree with instead of pushing."
